{"unit_id":"Altairpaca__dsh-computer-use-windows#card-zh","repo":"Altairpaca/dsh-computer-use-windows","commit":"8d1457494ea18ec675bcfe8d9b9925ca53225469","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-windows 是面向 Windows 的 DSH 桌面工具插件，向工具注册表加入截图、OCR、鼠标、键盘、窗口管理、文字定位点击、校准、配置与健康检查能力。它通过 PowerShell helper 操作目标窗口，支持 OCR 定位后验证点击结果，也可选用兼容视觉模型分析截图。适合需要让 DSH 读取 Windows 屏幕并执行桌面交互的场景；视觉功能需配置提供方及凭据，纯 OCR 模式可关闭视觉。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/index.js:103-240","helper/cu.ps1:329-413"]}
{"unit_id":"Altairpaca__dsh-computer-use-windows#card-en","repo":"Altairpaca/dsh-computer-use-windows","commit":"8d1457494ea18ec675bcfe8d9b9925ca53225469","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-computer-use-windows adds Windows screenshot, OCR, mouse, keyboard, and window tools to DSH. Its text-targeted click can verify screen state. An optional vision tool analyzes screenshots through a configured provider. Vision needs provider credentials; OCR works with vision disabled.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/index.js:103-240","helper/cu.ps1:329-413"]}
