{"unit_id":"Altairpaca__dsh-computer-use-windows#feature-1","repo":"Altairpaca/dsh-computer-use-windows","commit":"8d1457494ea18ec675bcfe8d9b9925ca53225469","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-windows 的功能「屏幕截图」：通过 computer_screenshot 获取整个虚拟屏幕或指定窗口的截图，并返回图像路径、尺寸和窗口坐标偏移。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/index.js:117-128"]}
